==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|blood bath}}

===Etymology===
Coined in [[w:1867|1867]]. Compound of {{compound|blood|bath|lang=en}} the latter used to refer in the metaphorical sense to a [[deluge]] of a thing.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈblʌdˌbæθ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[blood]][[bath]]}}

